From f79a7dc5f81aa71b078ab234c205313509862cce Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jan Kuzelka <jan@kuzelka.dev>
Date: Fri, 17 Apr 2026 11:44:02 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] aarch64: fix symbol naming for Mach-O (FUNC_NAME)

Apply FUNC_NAME macro to all AArch64 assembly symbols to ensure
correct leading underscore handling on macOS.

No functional changes.
---
 cipher/asm-poly1305-aarch64.h        |   8 +-
 cipher/camellia-aarch64.S            |  16 ++--
 cipher/chacha20-aarch64.S            |  16 ++--
 cipher/cipher-gcm-armv8-aarch64-ce.S |  24 ++---
 cipher/rijndael-aarch64.S            |  16 ++--
 cipher/rijndael-armv8-aarch64-ce.S   | 136 +++++++++++++--------------
 cipher/sha1-armv8-aarch64-ce.S       |   8 +-
